    "sections": {
        "description": "SaleCraft Ecommerce is a modern and versatile theme designed for online stores, digital shops, and ecommerce businesses of all sizes. It delivers a seamless shopping experience, enabling store owners to present products clearly and attractively while maintaining a clean, professional, and visually appealing look. Fully compatible with WooCommerce, SaleCraft Ecommerce supports multiple product categories, flexible product layouts, smooth checkout processes, and easy customization of colors, typography, and page structures. Optimized for performance, speed, and SEO, the theme enhances user engagement and ensures better search engine visibility. Ideal for entrepreneurs, small business owners, and growing online ventures, SaleCraft Ecommerce combines elegant design with practical functionality, giving you a reliable foundation for a professional, user-friendly, and scalable online store. This theme empowers businesses to build a modern ecommerce website that attracts customers, drives sales, and adapts to evolving online marketplace demands efficiently."
    },
